  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 905.01 Applicability. The rules in this part shall apply to the management of waste or scrap tires, from the point of waste origination to the point of waste disposal.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91, EXPIRED: 7-1-97\n\nNew. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 900); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2605.01); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
